                            <comment id="17065270" author="zjffdu" created="Tue, 24 Mar 2020 02:54:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mashuai_191&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mashuai_191&quot;&gt;mashuai_191&lt;/a&gt;&#160;It is correct for my_open return None. Because this method&apos;s signature is void. The problem here is that we didn&apos;t redirect the java stdout to interpreter&apos;s output. Let me try to fix it.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
